 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Stating your opinion clearly",
     "texto": [
      "To introduce your opinion: **meiner Meinung nach** (in my opinion), **ich bin der Ansicht, dass** (I believe that), **aus meiner Sicht** (from my point of view). Then comes a reason: **Ich bin der Ansicht, dass das Projekt sinnvoll ist** (I believe that the project makes sense).",
      "To order arguments: **zum einen … zum anderen** (on the one hand … on the other), **außerdem** (also), **darüber hinaus** (beyond that)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nuance of **sinnvoll**",
     "texto": [
      "It can mean «useful», «making sense» or «sensible», depending on the context. **Vernünftig** usually stresses that a decision is reasonable or prudent."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
